"P3142474748" "Diabolique is using the magic of the Banished Pantheon to create a massive energy shell which repels all attackers, thus keeping the Incarnates from accessing the inner plateau on which the captured heroes are held. In order to gain access to the inner plateau, find and destroy the four Repulsive Spines scattered around the grounds of the cemetery."
// Generic String :
"P1533101862" "Hospital Door Unlocked!"
// Generic String :
"P1172875117" "The Warmth of Prometheus Granted!"
// Generic String :
"P1458019102" "Badge Challenge Unsuccessful!"
// Generic String :
"P286119756" "<t=7 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color #FF99DD><bgcolor Black>From within Mot, a dark shadow reaches out to your mind. It is Diabolique.<t=7 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color #FF33BB><bgcolor Black>I never did properly thank you for all you did to prepare Mot for my ritual.<t=7 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color #FF33BB><bgcolor Black>First, you eliminated his ability to leave this place, containing all his power into Dark Astoria.<t=7 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color #FF33BB><bgcolor Black>Then, you foolishly attempted to 'mop up' after the deed was done, leaving the Freedom Phalanx and Vindicators open for capture.<t=7 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color #FF33BB><bgcolor Black>And now you come to try and stop me, but I assure you, you are too late. <t=7 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color #FF33BB><bgcolor Black>Soon, the ritual will be complete. Soon, all those you seek to rescue will be consumed.<t=7 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color #FF33BB><bgcolor Black>Mot and I will be as one, and then I shall come for you."
// Generic String :
"P4136011225" "<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color #BBBBBB><bgcolor Black>Dream Doctor reaches out from... somewhere... to reassure you.<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>Don't listen to her. She's just trying to get in your mind, make you give yourself to her willingly.<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>We have a plan, and I am fairly certain it will work, so all you need to do is stick to it.<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>First order of business is to get through that field protecting the plateau.<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>I feel the energy from the fields emanating from several spines which have broken through the surface.<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>Find and destroy all of them, and the field should come down... I think."
// Generic String :
"P1504287329" "<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>Dream Doctor: Yes, yes, that worked just as I expected!<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>There was a quite tangible weakening in the energy sustaining that protective field.<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>Keep up the pressure! Find and destroy the rest of those spines!"
// Generic String :
