"P549519542" "You have breached the external defenses keeping you from approaching Mot. You are now able to extract the captured members of the Freedom Phalanx and the Vindicators."
// Generic String :
"P683593431" "<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color #BBBBBB><bgcolor Black>Dream Doctor speaks to you after your success.<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>That was the last of the spines. The field protecting the plateau is gone!<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>Quickly now! Make your way up there and free as many as you can!"
