"P897061241" "You have breached the external defenses keeping you from approaching Mot. You are now able to extract the captured members of the Freedom Phalanx and the Vindicators.<br><br>To free a captured hero, first defeat all of the guards around a Soulsiphon Spine. That spine will then be free to interact with, allowing the ritual keeping the hero imprisoned to be stopped. <br><br>However, the heroes have been in Diabolique's thrall for so long that they will initially treat you as an opponent. Defeat them to free them from her control and complete their rescue.<br><br>Bonuses given to the Sentinel due to unrecovered Heroes:<br>Back Alley Brawler or Mynx: +DMG, +RECH, Fear<br>Manticore or Aurora Borealis: +RNG, +ToHit, Weaken<br>Positron or Valkyrie: +DEF, +Regen, -DMG<br>Numina or Swan: +ToHit, +RNG, Heal/DMG Field<br>Penelope Yin or Luminary: +Regen, +RES, DMG Pulse<br>Synapse or Ms. Liberty: +RECH, +DMG, EndDrain<br>Citadel or Infernal: +RES, +DEF, Hold<br><br>"
// Generic String :
"P1191472153" "Too Few Players to Continue!"
// Generic String :
"P1420074300" "Hospital Door Locked! Next Unlock in 20 seconds!"
// Generic String :
"P3661210205" "Hospital Door unlocks in 10 seconds!"
// Generic String :
"P177740375" "Hospital Door unlocks in 5 seconds!"
// Generic String :
"P2692826546" "Hospital Door Unlocked for 10 seconds!"
// Generic String :
"P3824312707" "<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color #FF99DD><bgcolor Black>From the darkness, Diabolique taunts you further.<t=7 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color #FF33BB><bgcolor Black>You insist on pursuing this folly, then?<t=7 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color #FF33BB><bgcolor Black>Each step you make closer to Mot brings you closer to my domain... brings you closer to me.<t=7 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color #FF33BB><bgcolor Black>Go ahead, free those wretched fools if you think you can. You'll never be able to get them all before they become one with Mot.<t=7 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color #FF33BB><bgcolor Black>Their power will be mine, and with Dominatrix here with me, the ritual's success is assured.<t=7 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color #FF33BB><bgcolor Black>But, please, keep coming closer to me... it shall make my hunting you down that much easier!"
// Generic String :
"P3374040513" "<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color #BBBBBB><bgcolor Black>Once more, Dream Doctor speaks out against Diabolique.<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>Bah! She is wrong! My projections show... oh... this can't be right.<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>So, it turns out she's actually right. I'm showing that each of the captured heroes is struggling to retain control over themselves.<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>Even if you did manage to free them, I fear you will need to fight them to bring them to their senses.<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>And even then, it looks like you'll only be able to save four before they all become a part of Mot.<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>Let's just hope it's not permanent..."
