"P2684063784" "After freeing Marcus' soul from the Sentinel, the creature became enslaved to Diabolique. It now serves her, with much of its power being drawn from the heroes she has absorbed."
// Generic String :
"P2235293172" "<t=5 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=4><scale 1.75><color #FF99DD><bgcolor Black>The ground trembles as the Sentinel appears. Diabolique speaks:<t=6 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=5><scale 1.75><color #FF33BB><bgcolor Black>It is as I told you... you could not save them all in time.<t=6 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=5><scale 1.75><color #FF33BB><bgcolor Black>Don't worry, though, I've seen to it that their power is put to good use.<t=7 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color #FF33BB><bgcolor Black>I am sure that the new 'pet' you provided me when Marcus died will appreciate its new gifts from those I still hold.<t=7 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color #FF33BB><bgcolor Black>Behold, then, my Sentinel. In these final moments before it claims you, know that all of this would have been impossible had you not interfered...."
// Generic String :
"P1729618367" "After freeing Marcus' soul from the Sentinel, the creature became enslaved to Diabolique. It now serves her, with much of its power being drawn from the heroes she has absorbed.<br><br>For each hero which was not rescued earlier, the Sentinel will acquire additional combat bonuses and a unique proc attack. Most of these additional attacks are Targeted AoEs that will hit a target and those around them, but one of them places a field around the Sentinel's feet.<br><br>Additionally, the Sentinel will strike its main target every few seconds with a stacking heal debuff. Eventually, that target will not be able to be healed, so it is important that the Sentinel's main target changes every so often.<br><br>Finally, the Sentinel has two massive attacks at its disposal: Voracious Maw, which will summon a set of tearing mouths to harm all those in a large area, and Impale, which causes crystals of pure death to burst out of the ground."
// Generic String :
"P1774899576" "<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color #BBBBBB><bgcolor Black>Dream Doctor contacts you once more<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>Ignore her taunts. This is going pretty much according to plan.<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>The Sentinel is the last thing standing between you and Mot.<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>Once that creature is out of the way, you can descend inside and bring the fight to Diabolique.<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>This is almost over!"
// Generic String :
"P1580135643" "The Sentinel is reinforced by Diabolique!"
