"P331614917" "The Descent"
// Generic String :
"P3070820948" "Prepare for your descent into Mot's body, which is where Dream Doctor has determined Diabolique to be performing her ritual."
// Generic String :
"P694126533" "<t=7 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color #FF99DD><bgcolor Black>Diabolique speaks again. An unexpected confidence is in her voice.<t=7 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color #FF33BB><bgcolor Black>Defeated the Sentinel have you? Ah, it's no matter. I'll make another out of your flesh and bone.<t=7 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color #FF33BB><bgcolor Black>As for your, plan... please, do enter Mot. I am waiting for you here."
// Generic String :
"P1209453475" "<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color #BBBBBB><bgcolor Black>Dream Doctor also exudes confidence as he speaks.<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>You heard her! Get in there. I've tracked her to a chamber within Mot.<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>You should certainly reach it from the mouth stretched out before you.<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>Now, Diabolique is prepared, so make sure you're ready!"
// Generic String :
"P1686073993" "Descend into Mot when you are ready."
// Generic String :
"P280785873" "Diabolique is not here! Dream Doctor is currently trying to find out where his divinations went wrong. Survive the onslaught of the Banished Pantheon and Diabolique's Demons until he is able to learn where she truly is working her ritual."
// Generic String :
"P3767465184" "What the... She has to be there!"
// Generic String :
"P3538268044" "These spells don't lie!"
// Generic String :
"P2073336522" "I... can you hold on in there?"
// Generic String :
"P126580935" "I need to find her! Stay alive!"
// Generic String :
"P3329532398" "<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color #BBBBBB><bgcolor Black>There is a strong panic in Dream Doctor's voice.<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>What the... where is she! She has to be there. These spells don't lie!<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>Uh... this can't be right. I... can you hold on in there? I need you to hold on!<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>I'll find her, I promise. Just... just stay alive, please?<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>Oh dear..."
// Generic String :
"P2315131328" "Pathetic fools! Following the blind to your deaths!"
// Generic String :
"P3713445915" "Did you think I would be so easily stopped?"
// Generic String :
"P3670024070" "Did you think I would not expect your assault?"
// Generic String :
"P3273276622" "Surrender! There is only death for you now."
// Generic String :
"P2126561620" "You have already fed your self to the beast!"
// Generic String :
"P2966381093" "Die now and feed your power to me!"
// Generic String :
"P2975541319" "<t=7 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color #FF99DD><bgcolor Black>Diabolique's voice echoes throughout the chamber.<t=7 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color #FF33BB><bgcolor Black>Oh, you pathetic fools, following a blind man to your deaths.<t=7 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color #FF33BB><bgcolor Black>Did you truly think I would allow myself to be exposed to your assaults?<t=7 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color #FF33BB><bgcolor Black>Did you think I would begin this ritual without preparing for your arrival?<t=7 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color #FF33BB><bgcolor Black>There is no hope. There is no chance for survival. Now, there is only your death.<t=7 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color #FF33BB><bgcolor Black>You've already fed yourself to the beast... just give up. Die now and feed your power to me."
// Generic String :
"P731967492" "I found her! She is there!"
// Generic String :
"P12101787" "Just... in another realm!"
// Generic String :
"P3108817217" "It is a shadow world, in which she rules!"
// Generic String :
"P2212343594" "I can send you there... soon!"
// Generic String :
"P1614551106" "I just need one of you to survive!"
// Generic String :
"P3781944594" "<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color #BBBBBB><bgcolor Black>Dream Doctor's voice breaks through the gloom.<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>I found her! She IS there... just... in another realm.<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>She's in a shadow world, mirrored with our own, but one in which she is becoming the ruler.<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>I... I can send you there, but I need you to hold on.<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>If at least one of you survives this, I can send you there! Stay alive!"
// Generic String :
"P2373701505" "I got it! I just need to finish this spell!"
// Generic String :
"P1029963108" "Once this spell is done, it will be safe!"
// Generic String :
"P1096509926" "Even if you fall, I can bring you to her!"
// Generic String :
"P3814134487" "But not yet!"
// Generic String :
"P2041933464" "Hold out for just a little longer!"
// Generic String :
"P1869371419" "<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color #BBBBBB><bgcolor Black>Dream Doctor speaks again, excitement in his voice.<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>I got it! It will be safe in one minute. Even if you die, I will be able to send you there.<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>Well, no... actually, you need to die so I can send you there... but not yet! I still need a little time!<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>Don't worry, I can keep you intact. She will not consume you.<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>I think."
// Generic String :
