"P1346438663" "Survive within Mot for:"
// Generic String :
"P2439468720" "Survive for:"
// Generic String :
"P2714390925" "Time to Recover from Defeat:"
// Generic String :
"P2545776225" "Recover by:"
// Generic String :
"P1907337937" "Survive within Mot by any means necessary!"
