"P3568003571" "The trial will end if everyone inside Mot is defeated!"
// Generic String :
"P1570668787" "Diabolique"
// Generic String :
"P1959715258" "Dream Doctor has determined that Diabolique is within a realm of shadow and death parallel to your own. To find Diabolique, you will need to perish. Do not fear, however, as Dream Doctor is ready to make sure you complete the transition to her realm."
// Generic String :
"P2037612690" "There! The spell is ready!"
// Generic String :
"P3526537509" "Oh! And not a moment too soon!"
// Generic String :
"P995289068" "I will take you there! Hold on!"
// Generic String :
"P1480554996" "<t=4 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=3><scale 1.75><color #BBBBBB><bgcolor Black>Dream Doctor speaks.<t=6 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=5><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>OK! It's safe now! If you die, I will take you to her!"
// Generic String :
"P4200941092" "Embrace death and enter the shadow realm!"
// Generic String :
"P1823676658" "Time until teleport:"
// Generic String :
"P86953111" "Teleport:"
// Generic String :
"P2020264636" "Dream Doctor has helped you complete the transition to Diabolique's realm and is preparing to raise you so the final battle can begin!"
// Generic String :
"P2167419028" "There! Now, to get you back into the fight!"
// Generic String :
"P2367984038" "<t=4 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=3><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>There! Now, to get you back into the fight!"
// Generic String :
"P3151318373" "Diabolique is taunting you as she readies for the final battle. You would do well to ensure you are ready for the fight ahead!"
// Generic String :
"P2434016521" "<t=7 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color #FF99DD><bgcolor Black>In the darkness, you can see Diabolique standing over Dominatrix.<t=7 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color #FF33BB><bgcolor Black>Impressive. I see that you have found your way here, and that your little helper managed to bring you through safely.<t=7 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color #FF33BB><bgcolor Black>It is a shame then, that you have come all this way to stand in my realm, just to die.<t=7 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color #FF33BB><bgcolor Black>I tried to be gracious... tried to give you a less agonizing death, but you persist. Now, you will suffer a torment unending.<t=4 x=0.2 y=0.2 d=3><scale 2><color #FF33BB><bgcolor Black>I am Death Incarnate!<t=4 x=0.3 y=0.3 d=3><scale 2.5><color #FF33BB><bgcolor Black>I am the ruler in this realm!<t=6 x=0.4 y=0.4 d=5><scale 3><color #FF33BB><bgcolor Black>And if you will not die for me willingly, then I shall see death forced upon you!"
// Generic String :
"P58318989" "Diabolique has engaged you in battle. Her ritual has progressed to the point where its completion is assured unless she is defeated, so act quickly!<br><br>Diabolique has several tricks up her sleeve. Like the Sentinel, she draws combat bonuses and proc effects from the heroes who have not yet been rescued.<br><br>Additionally, the many deaths caused by the previous battles have allowed her to begin creating Lifegiving essences, which she will consume every minute to heal herself.<br><br>Defeating Essences, however, will help the Incarnates. For each defeated Essence, living Incarnates will gain a heal over time, while defeated players will be fully restored and rendered untouchable for a short time, allowing them to re-engage Diabolique."
// Generic String :
"P933866008" "Diabolique has engaged you in battle. Her ritual has progressed to the point where its completion is assured unless she is defeated, so act quickly!<br><br>Diabolique has several tricks up her sleeve. Like the Sentinel, she draws combat bonuses and proc effects from the heroes who have not yet been rescued.<br><br>Additionally, the many deaths caused by the previous battles have allowed her to begin creating Lifegiving essences, which she will consume every minute to heal herself.<br><br>Further, she has acquired a deadly power, Singularity, from Dominatrix. This power places a miniature black hole around a target and grows to encompass more targets before exploding.<br><br>Finally, Diabolique is able to shatter both Earth and Souls. Earthshatter is a PBAoE that will bring the roof down, literally, on targets around her. Soulshatter is an insidious power which initially causes nothing but complacency, slowing those caught in its embrace. Eventually, the affected targets are unable to escape its grasp, at which point it explodes."
// Generic String :
"P1821869731" "Diabolique consumes remaining Essences!"
// Generic String :
"P2923450212" "Lifegiving Essences coalesce in the air!"
// Generic String :
"P4210050399" "<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color #BBBBBB><bgcolor Black>Dream Doctor's voice breaks through to this realm.<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>You're there! Oh... and so is she. Excellent! This is our chance.<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>You just need to keep Dominatrix alive... and stop the ritual. You've made it this far though, so you can manage that.<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>I'm nearly finished preparing the Dagger. As soon as you've dealt the final blow to Diabolique, I'll come in and use it.<t=7 x=0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color White><bgcolor Black>It should sever Mot's connection, and hers, to the Well... and THAT will put an end to this for good this time."
